      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 130,
      "npc" : "Taho",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Taho]",
      "translation" : "[塔霍]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 131,
      "npc" : "Taho",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Bakonawa becomes invincible at some point. When that time comes, listen to my guides carefully. Just trust me and all will be good.",
      "translation" : "巴科納瓦有時會變得無敵。到時候仔細聽我的指示。相信我，一切都會順利的。"
